# radar/ is entirely generated: app/'s Vite build output plus the JSON
# files npm run conv writes (radar/data.json, radar/releases/**) - see
# CLAUDE.md. old/ is the legacy vanilla-JS radar's hand-maintained shell
# (index.html, css/, js/, bootstrap/, deprecated.html) plus its own
# generated bits (config.json, releases/, html/ - covered above).
radar/

